Third-party software
--------------------
SplatWork does not bundle third-party source code in this repository. At run time, SplatWork Node and splatprep
download and use third-party packages under their own licences, including:

  * gsplat (Apache-2.0)                     https://github.com/nerfstudio-project/gsplat
  * PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause)                  https://pytorch.org
  * COLMAP / pycolmap (BSD-3-Clause)        https://colmap.github.io
  * GLOMAP (BSD-3-Clause)                   https://github.com/colmap/glomap
  * LightGlue (Apache-2.0)                  https://github.com/cvg/LightGlue
  * SAM 2 (Apache-2.0)                      https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2
  * FastAPI (MIT), zeroconf (LGPL-2.1), numpy (BSD-3-Clause), Pillow (MIT-CMU)

Model weights
-------------
Optional models are downloaded on request, each under its own licence, which SplatWork shows before installing.
Some of them, including SuperPoint, MASt3R and the VGGT-1B weights, are licensed for NON-COMMERCIAL use only.
